  "bodyText": "Skip to Main Content\nYour wedding team & everything in between\n\nJoin the free wedding planning platform that’s helped more than 30 million couples.\n\nSign up\nFind a couple\nFree wedding planning tools\nChecklist\n→\nKeep every detail organized by month.\nRegistry\n→\nAdd no-fee cash funds and gifts from any store.\nWedding website\n→\nOne spot for RSVPs, gifts and wedding details.\nInvites & paper\n→\nGet 3 free paper samples and shop stationery.\nBuild your team\n\nBrowse nearly 175,000 top-rated wedding vendors across 20 categories, backed by 4 million couple reviews.\n\nCategory\nReception Venues\nLocation\nSearch\nPhotographers\nDJs\nBeauty\nFlorists\nWedding dresses\nWedding rings\nSee all vendors\nFind your venue\nExplore venues\nLoved by couples\nIt made finding vendors, keeping track of things to complete, communicating with guests, creating a website and tracking gifts super easy!\nBlairre\nNEW ORLEANS, LA\nAPRIL 2026\nHaving all the details in one place has made the planning feel surprisingly fun. Creating our online wedding invitations has made sharing updates with out of town guests so quick and easy.\nMary\nMINNEAPOLIS, MN\nJANUARY 2026\nI found my venue and photographer through The Knot, and I can even create my free wedding website. Even my DJ is listed on The Knot!\nKay\nREDWOOD CITY, CA\nSEPTEMBER 2024\nWe were recommended to The Knot by our closest friends. The Knot has made our wedding process so easy and stress free!\nMcKenna\nEDMOND, OK\nFEBRUARY 2026\nFree!!! Very helpful every step of the way and extremely user friendly.\nHailey\nMADISON, WI\nDECEMBER 2023\nThe wedding planning app with the most 5-star reviews\nGet the app\nThe Knot is your free, all-in-one wedding planning platform.\nSign up\nFind a couple\nPhoto: Alex W Photography, KT Crabb Photography, Nate Shepard Photo, Patrick Quezada, Renee Hollingshead Photography\nWEDDING VENUES BY STATE\nWEDDING VENUES IN POPULAR CITIES\nWEDDING VENDORS BY TYPE\nWEDDING PHOTOGRAPHERS IN POPULAR CITIES\nWEDDING PLANNERS IN POPULAR CITIES\nWEDDING VIDEOGRAPHERS IN POPULAR CITIES\nWEDDING INVITATIONS AND PAPER\nWEDDING INVITATIONS BY STYLE\nWEDDING INVITATIONS BY COLOR",
